OpenAI reference implementations

The following elementary helper implementations match code patterns in
OpenAI's math library, which was consulted during development. They are
credited conservatively to that library and treated as Apache-2.0 material.
This treatment is limited to the listed helpers, rather than their entire
containing files. It does not assert that similarity proves historical copying.
The Apache License, Version 2.0, is included in LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.
Local formulations use project-specific averaging definitions and namespaces,
helper renamings, and an ENNReal-valued congruence generalization.

